OL,3,AUS pressures Europe over diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he may ask
OL,7,FEuropean countries to release some of
OL,8,Ftheir diesel reserves as he mulls a ban
OL,9,Fon US exports of the fuel amid a global
OL,10,Fshortage.
OL,12,FThe comments followed his Treasury
OL,13,FSecretary Scott Bessent urging Europe
OL,14,Fto immediately ready and release such
OL,15,Fsupplies, arguing that US "farmers,
OL,16,Ftruckers, and businesses should not be
OL,17,Fleft carrying the burden" as prices
OL,18,Fsoar.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
