OL,3,AUS pressures Europe over diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has threatened to restrict
OL,7,Fdiesel exports amid surging costs due
OL,8,Fto the war in Iran. The issue is top of
OL,9,Fmind for US voters ahead of the crucial
OL,10,Fmidterm elections.
OL,12,FOn Thursday, the UK held talks with
OL,13,FEuropean partners about the potential
OL,14,Frelease of diesel reserves in response
OL,15,Fto any ban.
